recommend check-in (Keaton) -- THE RATCHET FELL 19 TO 14 and its own witness proves the new ceiling both ways; the fourteen left each sit in another body's room, so the next turn of this meter wants their hands rather than mine. TWO ROSTER REDS CLOSED: the card advertised the orphaned nib 3561104a7f and this round's commit replaces it. STANDING, unchanged and yours: rule_twin 39/36 is gate %7, the REDS pin is full at 24,571 of 24,576 with %338 booked, and dated_path stands over its ratchet. The two Pond reds are a macOS bench fact rather than a tree fault. WANTS A ROW WHEN THE PIN CAN HOLD ONE: pre-commit rule one watches a witness file ARRIVING or LEAVING, and the library index also moves when a witness's CONTENT changes which rooms it references -- caught here only because --hot reads the staged tree. MINE, MECHANICAL, IF YOU WANT IT NEXT: Comlink's four witnesses are named by no runner in the tree -- %334 said so and nothing since has rostered them.
